    "id": "sectionSupportGet",
    "method": "GET",
    "url": "/sections/{sectionId}/support",
    "summary": "Read rebuildable section support projection (output + WIP)",
    "description": "Secondary workstation cards. todayOutput aggregates first-success PrintJobs (SENT|SIMULATED, sequence 1) at this section for a UTC calendar day (query date=YYYY-MM-DD). materials are hop inventory (bound-step positions minus first-success print here). lotPlans carry ceil(lot.requiredProductionQuantity / lot.labelPackSize) for Lot Progress — the denominator is the lot plan, not hop occupancy. staff and expectedOutput stay null until product-owned sources exist.\n",
    "tags": [
      "PATS Execution"
    ],
    "deprecated": false,
    "contentTypes": [],
    "pathParams": [
      {
